.TH ENGINE_TEXT_INPUT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
engine_text_input \- Turn delivery of typed characters on or off
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqengine.h\(dq
.BI "void engine_text_input(Engine *e, bool on);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Turn delivery of typed characters on or off. While on, Input.text holds the characters typed this frame (UTF\-8, short). Turn on in a scene's on_enter and off in on_exit. Letter keys still report as key presses while on.
.SH MODULE
core (src/engine/core/engine.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR key_pressed (3),
.BR gge\-input (7),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
